## Start the next session

Inside a paper workspace funded with 10000.0 USD:

```bash
kraken session start \
  --symbols BTC/USD \
  --channels trade \
  --to jsonl \
  --strategy recipe-playground-price-alert \
  --strategy-params '{"upper":70000,"lower":60000,"interval_s":300}' \
  --label btc-levels
```

## Review the run

```bash
kraken session show --session latest -o json
kraken session decisions --session latest -o json
kraken explain pnl --session latest -o json
kraken lab score --session latest -o json
```

